@rinevard I resolved the shift-scrolling while scaling, by disabling the option - good find, I actually figured out to make it work first, but then I realised that this and the ctrl-scrolling is disabled when box selecting, so I think it's sensible to do the same for this.

Please let me know if anyone finds anything more.

